    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🌐 GLOBEX AI — MASTER SUPABASE SQL TRADE WORKFLOW\n\n**REAL SUPABASE SQL DATABASE OPERATIONAL:**\nConnected directly to Supabase PostgreSQL Database at `https://inakttzrxtyvzxsqooir.supabase.co` using API Key credentials.\n\n**5 INTEGRATED SQL SUB-PIPELINES:**\n1. 🧠 **AI Trade Analysis Engine & SQL Opportunity Logger** (`POST /webhook/analyze-trade` & `/webhook/test-trade-analysis`)\n2. 📄 **Document OCR & SQL Hash Verification** (`POST /webhook/document-uploaded`)\n3. 🤝 **Marketplace Institutional Buyer SQL Matcher** (`POST /webhook/marketplace-match`)\n4. 🔐 **Trade Lifecycle & SQL Escrow Vault Creation** (`POST /webhook/create-trade`)\n5. 🚢 **Maritime Tracking & Vessel GPS Telemetry** (`POST /webhook/track-shipment`)\n\n**SUPABASE SQL TABLES INVOLVED:**\n- `public.trade_analysis` (Stores ML Dual-GRU predictions & Z-scores)\n- `public.organizations` (Stores verified institutional exporters & buyers)\n- `public.trades` (Stores executed cross-border trade contracts)\n- `public.escrow_accounts` (Stores locked USDC smart contract vaults)\n- `public.blockchain_records` (Stores Bill of Lading SHA-256 hashes)\n- `public.trade_documents` (Stores OCR verification audits)\n- `public.shipments` (Stores live maritime AIS tracking telemetry)",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 500,
        "color": 4
      },
